    "detailed_description": "TOON is a Pinball game.<br><br><strong> - PROCEDURAL LEVEL GENERATION - </strong><br>Each level is procedural with random elements so you will be faced with unique levels each time you play. <br><br>The fast-paced action is spiced up with a beautiful art found throughout the procedural level generation each time you play.<br><br>Gameplay<br>The player enter into a procedural generated level and need to clear the entire level from enemies to go to the next level.<br><br><strong>Features and Content</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Levels with different themes and enemies<br></li><li>  All level are procedurally and ramdomly generated to add more randomness to each gameplay ( Every game is different - random levels ).<br></li><li>  Amazing Art ( Old Cartoon Style )<br></li><li>  Black and White Mode ( Old Cartoon Style )</li></ul>",
